systemd-analyze Overall boot time systemd-analyze blame Slowest startup
services systemd-analyze critical-chain Service dependency chain
systemctl --failed Failed services journalctl -b Boot logs journalctl
-xe Detailed system logs df -h Disk usage free -h Memory usage dmesg
Kernel messages smartctl -a /dev/sda Disk health (SMART) cat /etc/fstab
Verify mount configuration

